title: 'pcglasso: fast Partial Correlation Graphical LASSO'
abstract: >-
  A fast Python implementation of the Partial Correlation Graphical LASSO
  (PCGLASSO) with the iterative coordinate-descent core written in Rust
  (PyO3 / maturin).
